    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A free trial of the Prologue will be available in October 2023. </h2><br>A high school campus is on edge under a series of mysterious disappearances...<br>A post-apocalyptic wasteland is in the midst of a zombie crisis...<br>Both of the worlds, both of the crises are the truth presented. <br>The worlds cross on you. <br>You are the only one who can travel between the worlds, and the key to changing the fate of many characters is in your hands.<br><br>---<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play 4+1 story branches and develop relationships with characteristic girls.<br></li><li>Experience a high degree of freedom with plot options &amp; rich feedback on character favorability. <br></li><li>Clear levels with real-time battles.<br></li><li>Discover alien items and discover their truth in the other side of the world.</li></ul>",
